<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: IAWS half-year pre-tax profit up 27 pct.</title>
<headline>IAWS half-year pre-tax profit up 27 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to January 31, 1997</p>
<p>(million punts unless stated)</p>
<p>Share (pence)				    3.89	     vs    2.79</p>
<p>Dividend (pence)				 1.531	    vs    1.392</p>
<p>Pretax profit				    6.1		vs    4.80</p>
<p>Turnover					  270		 vs  246.03</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name - IAWS Group Plc is an agribusiness group.</p>
